description: App name, display name, and in.medmate bundle id
alwaysApply: true
---

# Identity

- App name matches `^[a-z][a-z0-9]*$` (example: `consumers`).
- Bundle id and Android package are `in.medmate.<appName>`.
- Display name is a separate field and is the only value used as `expo.name`.
- Every EAS profile uses that same bundle id. Do not add a `.dev` suffix.
- Read identity from `identity.json`. Do not hard-code a second bundle id.
- URL scheme is `medmate-<appName>`.
